d 'SURVEYE': module to create an interactive HTML dashboard from a Survey Solutions or SurveyCTO questionnaire and the corresponding Stata data
d
d   Load one survey data file and point surveye to the
d questionnaire.  Three questionnaire	 files are accepted,
d detected by content rather than extension: a Survey Solutions   
d questionnaire preview (HTML); a SurveyCTO form definition (XML,
d downloaded in SurveyCTO    under Design - form files), which is
d read exactly, including groups, repeats, choice    lists,
d translations, and calculate fields; and a SurveyCTO printable
d form (HTML) - the    printed Field/Question/Answer table is read
d directly, including group sections, nested	and repeated
d subgroups, choice lists, and relevance conditions.  Printables do
d not	 encode field types, so choice fields import as select_one
d and open or note fields as	text; notes drop automatically when
d no matching data column exists.  When a printable    layout is
d not recognized, the error points to the XML definition. 
d SurveyCTO split    select_multiple exports (field_1, field_2,
d ...) are reassembled automatically. 
d
d KW: survey data
d KW: World Bank data
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260802
d
d Author:  Attique Ur Rehman,  Enterprise Analysis Unit, World Bank
d Support: email attique@@worldbank.org
d
f surveye.ado
f surveye.sthlp
f surveye.jar
f surveye_2_2_0.jar
f surveye_example.do
